#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:event_raffle_survey.field_event_raffle_start_wizard__survey_question_match
msgid "Answered"
msgstr "Répondu à"

#. module: event_raffle_survey
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:event_raffle_survey.selection__event_raffle_start_wizard__survey_question_match__any
msgid "At least one"
msgstr "Au moins une"

#. module: event_raffle_survey
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/event_raffle_survey/wizard/event_raffle_start_wizard.py:0
msgid "Choose the survey whose respondents enter the raffle."
msgstr "Choisissez le sondage dont les répondants entrent dans le tirage."

#. module: event_raffle_survey
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:event_raffle_survey.selection__event_raffle_start_wizard__survey_question_match__all
msgid "Each"
msgstr "Chacune"

#. module: event_raffle_survey
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/event_raffle_survey/wizard/event_raffle_start_wizard.py:0
msgid "Guest"
msgstr "Invité"

#. module: event_raffle_survey
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:event_raffle_survey.field_event_raffle_start_wizard__survey_respondent_count
msgid "How many people Start puts in the raffle, with the choices made above."
msgstr ""
"Nombre de personnes que Démarrer met dans le tirage, selon les choix ci-"
"dessus."

#. module: event_raffle_survey
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:event_raffle_survey.field_event_raffle_start_wizard__survey_id
msgid ""
"Its respondents enter the raffle instead of the registrations: every "
"completed answer that is not a test and answers at least one question."
msgstr ""
"Ses répondants entrent dans le tirage à la place des inscrits : toute "
"participation terminée qui n'est pas un test et répond à au moins une "
"question."

#. module: event_raffle_survey
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:event_raffle_survey.field_event_raffle_start_wizard__survey_question_ids
msgid ""
"Optional. When the list holds questions, only the respondents who answered "
"them enter the raffle: each of them, or at least one, as Answered says."
msgstr ""
"Facultatif. Si la liste contient des questions, seuls les répondants qui y "
"ont répondu entrent dans le tirage : à chacune, ou à au moins une, selon « "
"Répondu à »."

#. module: event_raffle_survey
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:event_raffle_survey.field_event_raffle_start_wizard__copy_strategy
msgid "Participants"
msgstr "Participants"

#. module: event_raffle_survey
#: model:ir.model,name:event_raffle_survey.model_event_raffle_participant
msgid "Raffle Participant"
msgstr "Participant au tirage"

#. module: event_raffle_survey
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:event_raffle_survey.field_event_raffle_start_wizard__survey_question_ids
msgid "Required Questions"
msgstr "Questions exigées"

#. module: event_raffle_survey
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:event_raffle_survey.field_event_raffle_start_wizard__survey_respondent_count
msgid "Respondents Entering"
msgstr "Répondants retenus"

#. module: event_raffle_survey
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:event_raffle_survey.field_event_raffle_start_wizard__survey_anonymous_count
msgid ""
"Respondents with no contact, email or nickname: each enters as a separate "
"Guest, and a guest who wins cannot be identified."
msgstr ""
"Répondants sans contact, courriel ni pseudo : chacun entre comme un Invité "
"distinct, et un invité gagnant ne peut pas être identifié."

#. module: event_raffle_survey
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:event_raffle_survey.field_event_raffle_participant__source
msgid "Source"
msgstr "Source"

#. module: event_raffle_survey
#: model:ir.model,name:event_raffle_survey.model_event_raffle_start_wizard
msgid "Start a Raffle from an Event"
msgstr "Démarrer un tirage à partir d'un événement"

#. module: event_raffle_survey
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:event_raffle_survey.field_event_raffle_start_wizard__survey_id
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:event_raffle_survey.selection__event_raffle_participant__source__survey
msgid "Survey"
msgstr "Sondage"

#. module: event_raffle_survey
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:event_raffle_survey.selection__event_raffle_start_wizard__copy_strategy__survey_only
msgid "Survey filled only"
msgstr "Sondage rempli seulement"

#. module: event_raffle_survey
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/event_raffle_survey/wizard/event_raffle_start_wizard.py:0
msgid "The required questions must be questions of the chosen survey."
msgstr "Les questions exigées doivent être des questions du sondage choisi."

#. module: event_raffle_survey
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:event_raffle_survey.field_event_raffle_start_wizard__survey_question_match
msgid ""
"Which of the required questions a respondent must have answered: each of "
"them, or at least one."
msgstr ""
"Les questions exigées auxquelles un répondant doit avoir répondu : chacune, "
"ou au moins une."

#. module: event_raffle_survey
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:event_raffle_survey.field_event_raffle_start_wizard__copy_strategy
msgid ""
"Who enters the raffle. Both 'Questionnaire' choices keep only the attendees "
"who answered the event's registration questionnaire."
msgstr ""
"Qui entre dans le tirage. Les deux choix « Questionnaire » ne gardent que "
"les inscrits ayant répondu au questionnaire d'inscription de l'événement."
